---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Move a sender to people, Reading, Paper trail or screened out, for their mail now and later; `auto` hands it back to the automatic rules

Usage: mxr sender kind [OPTIONS] <EMAIL> <KIND>

Arguments:
  <EMAIL>
  <KIND>   [possible values: people, reading, paper-trail, screened-out, auto]

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>  The account the sender writes to; defaults to the only or default account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
